Action HTTP Route Success Error <code>save</code> POST <code>/api/v1/orders</code> 201 + order 400 <code>show</code> GET <code>/api/v1/orders/{id}</code> 200 + order 404 <code>byCustomer</code> GET <code>/api/v1/orders/customer/{customerId}</code> 200 + paginated — <code>byStatus</code> GET <code>/api/v1/orders/status/{status}</code> 200 + paginated 400 (invalid enum) <code>updateStatus</code> PATCH <code>/api/v1/orders/{id}/status?newStatus=</code> 200 + order 404, 400 <code>cancel</code> POST <code>/api/v1/orders/{id}/cancel</code> 200 404, 400 <p>Request body for <code>save</code>: <pre><code>{
  "customerId": 1,
  "shippingAddress": "42 Wallaby Way, Sydney",
  "notes": "Leave at door",
  "items": [
    { "bookId": 3, "quantity": 2 },
    { "bookId": 7, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> <p>Query param for <code>cancel</code>: <code>reason</code> (optional string; defaults to "Customer requested cancellation")</p>
